23 0 obj<</Subj(Text Box)/Type/Annot/P 5 0 R/F 4/C[]/CreationDate(D:20240114075134+03'00')/T(CWalsh)/Subtype/FreeText/BS<</W 0/S/S/Type/Border>>/DA(1 0 0 rg /Helv 12 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica 12pt; text-align:left; margin:3pt; line-height:13.8pt; color:#FF0000)/M(D:20240114093736+03'00')/AP<</N 25 0 R>>/Rect[115.0314 733.8702 462.9913 762.5258]/NM(FCELYLMSTKIFYQMC)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" style="font:Helvetica 12pt; text-align:left; margin:3pt; line-height:13.8pt; color:#FF0000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>RFI-002 - Manhole Provision Excessive - Stormwater</p></body>)/Contents(RFI-002 - Manhole Provision Excessive - Stormwater)>>
