26 0 obj<</Subj(Text Box)/Type/Annot/P 5 0 R/F 4/C[]/CreationDate(D:20240114075231+03'00')/T(CWalsh)/Subtype/FreeText/BS<</W 0/S/S/Type/Border>>/DA(1 0 0 rg /Helv 8 Tf)/DS(font: Helvetica 8pt; text-align:left; margin:3pt; line-height:9.2pt; color:#FF0000)/M(D:20240114115358+03'00')/AP<</N 28 0 R>>/Rect[76.1418 380.2729 367.2 506.6729]/NM(NAHYKSRMLORTEIKT)/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2018" xfa:spec="2.2.0" style="font:Helvetica 8pt; text-align:left; margin:3pt; line-height:9.2pt; color:#FF0000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p style="line-height:9.2pt; font-size:8pt">Review an alternative constructable solution to this arrangement<span><span>.</span></span></p><p style="font-size:8pt">there are 24manholes installed within one bend in the road - totally excessive. An alternative solution can be proposed with a formed GRP radiused section for the respective pipework.</p><p style="font-size:8pt">The principle of installing a manhole in this location appears to be the radius of the pipework and not for access. </p><p style="font-size:8pt" /><p style="font-size:8pt">Recommendation - Revise to ensure</p><p style="font-size:8pt">- Time and Cost saving</p><p style="font-size:8pt">- Aesthetic Improvement of the streetscape which will foul future public realm and landscape design, potentially streetlighting and security impact.</p><p style="font-size:8pt">- utilise closed concrete channel - customised radius section and/or pipework </p><p style="font-size:8pt" /></body>)/Contents<>>>
endobj
